{"document":{"type":"root","children":[{"type":"heading","depth":1,"id":"variable-filterfn-indaterange","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Variable: filterFn_inDateRange"}]},{"type":"code","value":"const filterFn_inDateRange: CreatedFilterFn<any, any>;","lang":"ts"},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Defined in: "},{"type":"link","href":"https://github.com/TanStack/table/blob/main/packages/table-core/src/features/column-filtering/filterFns.ts#L331","children":[{"type":"text","value":"features/column-filtering/filterFns.ts:331"}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Keeps rows whose date value is inside an inclusive "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"[min, max]"},{"type":"text","value":" date range."}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Row values and range endpoints may be "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"Date"},{"type":"text","value":" objects, timestamps, or\nparseable date strings. Blank or invalid endpoints become open-ended and\nreversed endpoints are swapped. Rows without a valid date never match."}]}],"headings":[{"id":"variable-filterfn-indaterange","text":"Variable: filterFn_inDateRange","level":1}]},"frameworks":[],"downloadMarkdown":"\n# Variable: filterFn\\_inDateRange\n\n```ts\nconst filterFn_inDateRange: CreatedFilterFn<any, any>;\n```\n\nDefined in: [features/column-filtering/filterFns.ts:331](https://github.com/TanStack/table/blob/main/packages/table-core/src/features/column-filtering/filterFns.ts#L331)\n\nKeeps rows whose date value is inside an inclusive `[min, max]` date range.\n\nRow values and range endpoints may be `Date` objects, timestamps, or\nparseable date strings. Blank or invalid endpoints become open-ended and\nreversed endpoints are swapped. Rows without a valid date never match.\n","originalRawMarkdown":"---\nid: filterFn_inDateRange\ntitle: filterFn_inDateRange\n---\n\n# Variable: filterFn\\_inDateRange\n\n```ts\nconst filterFn_inDateRange: CreatedFilterFn<any, any>;\n```\n\nDefined in: [features/column-filtering/filterFns.ts:331](https://github.com/TanStack/table/blob/main/packages/table-core/src/features/column-filtering/filterFns.ts#L331)\n\nKeeps rows whose date value is inside an inclusive `[min, max]` date range.\n\nRow values and range endpoints may be `Date` objects, timestamps, or\nparseable date strings. Blank or invalid endpoints become open-ended and\nreversed endpoints are swapped. Rows without a valid date never match.\n"}
